SDUSD::totalAssets
├── when no reward period has been started
│   └── it should return accountedAssets
├── when a reward period is active
│   ├── at periodStart
│   │   ├── it should exclude the entire reward amount from total assets
│   │   └── it should preserve the pre-notification exchange rate without a spike
│   ├── between periodStart and rewardPeriodFinish
│   │   ├── it should return accountedAssets minus lockedRewardsRemaining
│   │   └── it should increase the exchange rate integer-linearly as rewards unlock
│   └── immediately before rewardPeriodFinish
│       └── it should include all rewards except the final still-locked fraction
├── when block timestamp equals rewardPeriodFinish
│   ├── it should return accountedAssets
│   └── it should include the full reward amount in the exchange rate
├── when block timestamp is after rewardPeriodFinish
│   ├── it should return accountedAssets
│   └── it should leave the fully vested exchange rate unchanged absent another state transition
└── when DUSD is transferred directly to the vault
    ├── it should not change accountedAssets
    ├── it should not change totalAssets or the exchange rate
    └── when a reward period is active
        ├── it should not change the locked reward amount or period timestamps
        └── it should not bypass the linear release schedule or change the exchange rate
